        "summary": "Connection health per platform",
        "description": "Shows every platform login the user has connected, its token health (active / needs re-authorisation / revoked), and the active + primary ad accounts under it.\nUse when: a platform tool failed with not_connected or needs_reauth, or before the first platform call in a conversation.\nReturns links the user can open to fix a broken connection. Reads Adako's database only — no platform calls.",
