        "description": "Returns the user's plan, tasks used vs limit for the current period, when it resets, ad accounts used this billing period vs the plan limit, and a link to the plans.\nUse when: a tool returned quota_exceeded or account_limit, or the user asks how many tasks or accounts they have left. Free; reads Adako's database only.\nA \"task\" is one billable tool call. System tools and resolvers are free. An ad account used this period keeps its place on the plan after it is switched off.",
