    "/api/v1/tools/list_what_i_can_do/execute": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "list_what_i_can_do",
        "summary": "Capability menu for the platforms this user has connected",
        "description": "Lists what Adako can actually do for THIS user: the tools available on the platforms they have connected, grouped by job, plus the Adako-level abilities that work without any platform. Free; reads the tool registry and the user's connections.\nUse when: the user asks what you can do, has just connected an account, or you need to know whether a capability exists before promising it.\nWhen not to use: you are looking for one specific tool — search_tools ranks by intent and is better for that.\nReturns counts per platform and a short grouped menu with the exact call line, since most platform tools are reached through their platform router rather than by name. It lists only what exists; it never promises a capability Adako has not shipped.",
