        "operationId": "meta_list_instagram_accounts",
        "summary": "List Instagram accounts an ad can run from",
        "description": "Lists the Instagram accounts this ad account may use as the ad's identity, both the ones linked directly to the ad account and the ones connected to its Pages.\nUse when: the user wants the ad to appear from a specific Instagram handle, or a creation tool asked for instagram_account_id.\nDo not guess an Instagram id from a handle: an ad created from the wrong identity is visible to the public under the wrong name.\nReturns each account's id and username, and which Page it is connected to where Meta says so.\nFree: this call does not cost a task. If the list is empty, the ads will run from the Facebook Page alone — say so rather than failing.",
