    "/api/v1/tools/meta_list_pages/execute": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "meta_list_pages",
        "summary": "List promotable Facebook Pages",
        "description": "Lists the Facebook Pages this ad account may advertise from, with any Instagram account linked to each one.\nUse when: creating an ad (every ad needs a Page), or when a creation attempt failed because no Page was given.\nDo not guess a Page id from a Page name in a URL — a Page the user administers is not necessarily one this ad account can promote.\nReturns the Page id for facebook_page_id and the Instagram account id for instagram_account_id. When more than one Page comes back, ask the user which one to advertise from; do not choose for them.\nIf the list is empty the user must add a Page to the ad account's Business portfolio before any ad can be created.",
