                    "type": "object",
                    "properties": {
                      "image_url": {
                        "description": "The image the ad will use. Adako hosts no files: the platform downloads this URL itself, from its own servers and often hours later, so it must be a public link straight to the file — not a file on the computer, not a Drive, Dropbox or design-tool share page, not a link that expires or asks for a login. Call check_media first: it repairs the usual share links, checks the file against this platform, and says where to put a file that has no link yet.",
