    "/api/v1/tools/chatgpt_pause_ad/execute": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "chatgpt_pause_ad",
        "summary": "Pause a ChatGPT Ads ad",
        "description": "Stops delivery on one ad and leaves everything around it running. Nothing is deleted: the creative, its review verdict and its history stay, and chatgpt_resume_ad starts it again.\nUse when: one creative is clearly worse than the others in the same ad group, and you have shown the user the numbers at ad level from chatgpt_get_performance.\nDo not pause the only ad in an ad group and call the ad group fixed — an ad group with no active ad delivers nothing at all; say that plainly instead.\nDo not judge a creative on a day of data. This platform's daily numbers are noisy at small budgets.\nReturns the ad read back from the platform, which is how the pause is confirmed rather than assumed.",
