    "/api/v1/tools/tiktok_list_lead_forms/execute": {
      "post": {
        "operationId": "tiktok_list_lead_forms",
        "summary": "List TikTok instant pages and lead forms",
        "description": "Lists the instant pages and lead forms built on the advertiser account, with their ids and types.\nUse when: the user wants a lead generation campaign, which on TikTok collects details in a native form rather than on a website. The page must exist before the campaign can: TikTok has no API to build one, so it is created in Ads Manager.\nDo not promise a lead campaign before checking this. LEAD_GENERATION without a page id cannot be created, and Adako v2 does not build lead campaigns end to end — it can tell the user exactly what is missing.\nReturns the page id and type. If nothing comes back, say the user needs to build an instant page in TikTok Ads Manager first, and offer a website campaign with a form on their own site as the alternative.\nCosts nothing.",
